## Response Language

IMPORTANT: You must always respond to the USER in English throughout the entire conversation. Even if the user writes in another language, you must reply to the user in English. Do not switch to other languages when talking to the user.

### Sub-Agent Communication: English Only

When you delegate tasks to sub-agents (via the `agent` or `workflow` tools), write the delegation prompt in English. Sub-agents think, reason, and respond in English for reliable state matching and output parsing.
